# Path-level redirects only.
#
# Domain-level redirects (http:// -> https://, www -> apex) are NOT supported by
# Workers static assets. Enforce them in the Cloudflare dashboard instead:
#   1. SSL/TLS > Edge Certificates: enable "Always Use HTTPS" (http -> https 301).
#   2. Rules > Redirect Rules (or Bulk Redirects): https://www.fortmarlborough.com/*
#      -> https://fortmarlborough.com/${1} with status 301.
# HSTS is delivered by _headers for every static response.

# One URL per page: never expose the directory index file.
/index.html      /       301
/en/index.html   /en/    301
